      <!-- SECTION 5 -->
      <section class="section" id="marketing">
        <h2>Market Positioning and Branding</h2>
        <p>
          The car care market is segmented into three distinct tiers: DIY Consumers, Professional Detailers, and Industrial/Commercial Wash Centers. Your brand's positioning depends on which segment you target. Professional detailers prioritize "slickness" and lubrication to avoid marring expensive paintwork, while commercial wash centers prioritize high-dilution ratios and extreme foam stability for touchless systems. Understanding these nuances allows for targeted formulations that solve specific user problems.
        </p>
        <p>
          Strategic branding should emphasize technical authority and safety. Highlighting that your formulation is "biodegradable" or "VOC-compliant" appeals to the modern, eco-conscious consumer. At Global Formulation, we help manufacturers navigate these choices, ensuring that their products are not only chemically superior but also positioned to capture maximum market share in a competitive landscape.
        </p>
